}{\plain \fs24 \f1 earth stand in awe of him.  }{\plain \fs20 \i\f1\fs20 Psalm 96:9}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24\sl120\slmult1 
{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
}\pard \fs24
