}{\plain \fs20 \i\f1\fs20 substitutes {\u8220\'93}us{\u8221\'94} for {\u8220\'93}you{\u8221\'94} and {\u8220\'93}our{\u8221\'94} for {\u8220\'93}your.{\u8221\'94}}{\plain \fs24 \f1 \par
