{\plain \fs24 \f1 Almighty God, Father of all mercies,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 we thine unworthy servants \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 do give thee most humble and hearty thanks\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 for all thy goodness and loving-kindness\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 to us and to all men.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 We bless thee for our creation, preservation,\par
