}{\plain \fs24 \f1 but above all for thine inestimable love\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 in the redemption of the world by our Lord Jesus Christ;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 for the means of grace, and for the hope of glory.\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 And, we beseech thee, \par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 give us that due sense of all thy mercies,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 that our hearts may be unfeignedly thankful;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 and that we show forth thy praise,\par
