}{\plain \fs24 \f1 in holiness and righteousness all our days;\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 through Jesus Christ our Lord,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 to whom, with thee and the Holy Ghost,\par
}{\plain \fs24 \f1 be all honor and glory, world without end. Amen.\par
